you follow targets, navigate roads, handle sharp turns and maintain control at high speeds. Stay focused during every pursuit and work to catch your targets while overcoming the challenges along the way.\n\n**Game Features**\n\n- **Police Driving:** Get behind the wheel of a police vehicle and experience exciting pursuit driving.\n- **High-Speed Chases:** Follow speeding targets and experience thrilling police chase action.\n- **Pursuit Challenges:** Take on exciting driving situations and test your skills.\n- **Vehicle Control:** Accelerate, brake and navigate roads during intense pursuits.\n- **Challenging Roads:** Handle turns and maintain control while chasing your targets.\n- **Police Chase Experience:** Enjoy the excitement of high-speed driving and pursuit gameplay.\n\nAre you ready to join the pursuit?\n\nStart your engine, take control of your police vehicle and experience the action in Police Chase!", "short_description": "Get behind the wheel and experience thrilling police pursuit action in Police Chase! Drive powerful police vehicles, chase speeding suspects and navigate challenging roads as you race to catch your targets. Test your driving skills, control your speed, handle sharp turns and stay focused during every pursuit. Take on exciting chase challenges, follow your targets and experience the adrenaline of high-speed police driving. Start your engine and join the chase!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Next_Bit", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/next-bit-games/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_i